{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":485365,"name":"John Solly","username":"jsolly","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/jsolly/{size}/33752_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-07T13:18:34.438Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485365-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485365-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"1:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Cursor IDE\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"2:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Cursor CLI\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"3:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Background Agent (GitHub, Slack, Web, Linear)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"4:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e BugBot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box checked fa fa-square-check-o\" data-chk-src=\"5:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Somewhere else: Grok Bot (also reproduces in Cursor IDE — see Additional Information)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485365-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485365-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOfficial GitHub marketplace plugin (id 48677658) stays \u003cstrong\u003eNeeds auth\u003c/strong\u003e. Clicking \u003cstrong\u003eAuthenticate\u003c/strong\u003e shows toast: \u003cstrong\u003e“Github didn’t provide a sign-in link”\u003c/strong\u003e. No browser/OAuth window. MCP \u003ccode\u003euser-Github\u003c/code\u003e: \u003ccode\u003eneedsAuth\u003c/code\u003e / \u003ccode\u003eauthentication_required\u003c/code\u003e, tools listed as 47 but unusable until auth.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485365-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485365-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGrok Bot desktop → Plugins → GitHub (installed).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAccount default shows Needs auth.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClick Authenticate.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eToast: Github didn’t provide a sign-in link. Still Needs auth.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485365-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485365-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAuthenticate opens GitHub OAuth / provides a sign-in link and completes connection.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485365-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485365-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/f/3/f302bb2b6c51d392f559e3e324bf3268b3c7545c.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/yFLSmbVQUcifTUWjmAZniNBdb9W.png?dl=1\" title=\"github-plugin-no-signin-link.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/f/3/f302bb2b6c51d392f559e3e324bf3268b3c7545c_2_570x500.png\" alt=\"github-plugin-no-signin-link.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"yFLSmbVQUcifTUWjmAZniNBdb9W\" width=\"570\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/f/3/f302bb2b6c51d392f559e3e324bf3268b3c7545c_2_570x500.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/f/3/f302bb2b6c51d392f559e3e324bf3268b3c7545c.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/f/3/f302bb2b6c51d392f559e3e324bf3268b3c7545c.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F5F